ent-WGPyramid = the Pyramid
    .desc = A mountain of chrome hangs in the dark. Space and time come off their hinges around it, and sound only reaches you in waves.
ent-WGPyramidMark = targeting mark
    .desc = A pale-blue reticle painted on the hull. Get out of it.
ent-WGChromeShard = chrome shard
    .desc = A flake of the Pyramid's skin. It's far heavier than it looks, and it's still warm. Collectors pay a fortune for these.

wg-pyramid-arrive = Something on the scanners isn't a ship. It has turned towards you.
wg-pyramid-stalled = The Pyramid shudders. Its lights stutter and it hangs still.
wg-pyramid-collapsing = The Pyramid groans as a thousand sun-weights crush its chrome skin!
wg-pyramid-folds = The Pyramid folds in on itself and is gone.

wg-pyramid-line-1 = PROTOCOL ONE: CONTAIN.
wg-pyramid-line-2 = PROTOCOL TWO: ERASE.
wg-pyramid-line-3 = PROTOCOL THREE: QUIET.
wg-pyramid-line-4 = PROTOCOL FOUR: PERSIST.
wg-pyramid-line-5 = TARGET SOLUTION FOUND. TARGET SOLUTION FOUND.
wg-pyramid-line-6 = YOUR VESSEL IS NOT IN THE REGISTRY.
wg-pyramid-line-7 = MASTER SERVER UNREACHABLE. ACTING ON LAST ORDERS.
wg-pyramid-line-8 = LAST ORDERS ISSUED: 4,096 YEARS AGO.
wg-pyramid-line-9 = RECALCULATING. RECALCULATING. FIRING.
wg-pyramid-line-10 = HOLD STILL.
wg-pyramid-line-11 = HA. HA-HA. HA-HA-HA.
wg-pyramid-line-12 = THIS SECTOR IS CLOSED.

cmd-wgpyramid-desc = Summons the Pyramid onto your ship, or brings it down.
cmd-wgpyramid-help = Usage: wgpyramid summon|collapse
cmd-wgpyramid-no-ship = Stand on a ship to summon the Pyramid onto it.
cmd-wgpyramid-summoned = Summoned {$pyramid}.
